          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 3.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Khukhwama siise sieneesio Yesu arakikha khukhwilwacha, naboola ali, “Yekanila, sikila bubwami bwe mwikulu buli siimbi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu alaanga banaabi bane",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nga aaba ne akeenda khu sikiingi sie nyanja eya Kalilaya abona babaandu babili wandaaye ne wandaaye. Simoni olaangwa Petero ne Andereya, ne bamwaata lutiimba mu nyanja, sikila baba banaabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababoolela ali, “Nondekho mala ndamukhola enywe mube banaabi be babaandu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balekha chindiimba chabwe khangu mala bamuloondakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oli esendakho abweeni abona babaandi babili wandaaye ne wandaaye, Yakobo ne Yoana babaana ba Sebetayo. Baba mu liaaro ne raarawabwe ne bang'oona chindiimba chabwe. Yesu abalaanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abwene ne abwene balekha liliaaro ne raarawabwe, mala bamuloondakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ekisia, elwacha lundi aonia",
          "type": "text"
