        },
        {
          "text": " Yesu aacha buli abuundu mu Kalilaya mwoosi ne ekisia mu chisinakooki chabwe ne elwacha Elomo Endayi eye bubwami, lundi ne aonia buli bulwaale ne butekhele mu baandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
